    "source": "Manufacturer spec sheets (Rheem Performance gas: form THD-PGRH N Rev. 12 and THD-PGHD N Rev. 6, 12/23; Rheem Performance electric: THD-PE06 N Rev. 6, 08/20 and THD-PEDR6 Rev. 3, 12/23) and the ENERGY STAR certified list for heat pump models (data/energystar-water-heaters.json)",
